    "content": {
      "introduction": "I have been using the SoundMax Pro Wireless Headphones for more than 30 days. I purchased them mainly for studying, traveling, online meetings and listening to music. After using them in different situations, I wanted to share my complete experience.",
      "fullDescription": "The SoundMax Pro is a modern wireless headphone designed for people who want premium features without paying the highest flagship prices. It includes active noise cancellation, Bluetooth 5.3, multiple microphones, comfortable over-ear cushions and a large battery.",
      "performance": "The audio performance is one of the strongest parts of this product. Music sounds clear and balanced, while the bass has enough power without becoming overwhelming. Vocals remain easy to hear even at higher volume levels.",
      "comfort": "The soft ear cushions provide a comfortable fit around the ears. The padded headband also helps reduce pressure during long listening sessions.",
      "batteryExperience": "Battery performance has been excellent during my testing. With normal usage, I was able to use the headphones for several days before needing to recharge them.",
      "finalOpinion": "Overall, the SoundMax Pro is an excellent option for students, remote workers, travelers and anyone who wants reliable wireless headphones with strong sound quality."
    },
